omponents and a specific view to inject your theme everywhere. Time to complete your first app!","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"stepsSection":[{"runtimePreview":"tutorial-onboarding-3-7.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to apply a theme everywhere in your app, or on specific view, one special ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is for you: the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/oudsthemeableview","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". This object will get a theme you instanciated and apply it as environment value. It will also instanciates some environment objects the components may need.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Define a ","type":"text"},{"code":"ContentView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", add in its ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"body","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with an instance of ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrangeTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and add inside your previously defined ","type":"text"},{"code":"HomeScreen","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","media":null,"code":"tutorial-onboarding-3-7.swift","caption":[]},{"runtimePreview":"tutorial-onboarding-3-8-LiquidGlass.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"navigation"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" components like a "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"tab bar","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":". The "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tab bar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is quite particular: its rendering will change depending if Liquid Glass is applied (i.e. iOS 26+) or not (i.e. until iOS 18).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Add a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar\/"},{"text":", with 3 items inside it: the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HomeScreen"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" and two fake views.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":null,"code":"tutorial-onboarding-3-8.swift","caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can see how it looks like with other themes like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SoshTheme"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WireframeTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeCompactTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessments","assessments":[{"type":"multiple-choice","content":[],"choices":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes! One view to rule them all!"}]}],"isCorrect":true},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any other view"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nope! You must ust the dedicated OUDS view to inject in subviews the theme"}]}],"isCorrect":false}],"title":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Which thing defines the theme to use everywhere?","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"multiple-choice","content":[],"choices":[{"isCorrect":true,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes, of course!","type":"text"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Of course you can mix views fro